    "codeLanguage": "javascript",
    "title": "Zmienne przypisujące wartości same sobie",
    "descriptionContent": "Dowiedz się, jak szybko zmieniać wartości zmiennych.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17311,
        "title": "Zadania",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146640,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Poznajmy nowe pojęcie, które wyjaśnia, jak zmienne śledzą takie rzeczy jak zdobywanie lub tracenie punktów w grze.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   button {&#xA;    background-color: darkBlue;&#xA;    border: none;&#xA;    border-radius: 8px;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    text-decoration: none;&#xA;    display: inline-block;&#xA;    font-size: 14px;&#xA;    padding: 6px 12px;&#xA;    margin: 0 12px 0 0;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Score: &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;amount&quot;&gt;15&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onclick=&quot;add()&quot;&gt;Gain +1&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onclick=&quot;remove()&quot;&gt;Lose -1&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   let score = 15;&#xA;   let amountCounter = document.getElementById(&quot;amount&quot;);&#xA;   &#xA;   function add() {&#xA;    score += 1;&#xA;    amountCounter.innerHTML = score;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   function remove() {&#xA;    score -= 1;&#xA;    amountCounter.innerHTML = score;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146641,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gdy tworzymy zmienną, <strong>przypisujemy</strong> jej wartość, na przykład przypisując <code>3</code> do <code>score</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146642,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Przypisanie do samej siebie</strong> ma miejsce, gdy ustawiamy zmienną na jej własną wartość. Na przykład możemy ustawić <code>playerHealth</code> na jego wartość <code>3</code> za pomocą <code>playerHealth = playerHealth</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerHealth = playerHealth;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>playerHealth</code>, następnie <code>=</code>, a potem <code>playerHealth</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146643,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ponieważ możemy przypisywać zmienne do nich samych, możemy zwiększać lub zmniejszać zmienne liczbowe. Spróbuj zwiększyć wartość <code>playerHealth</code> o 1.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerHealth = playerHealth + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3 + 1\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"53\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>playerHealth + 1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146644,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zmienne przypisujące wartości same do siebie pozwalają śledzić dane, które zmieniają się w czasie. Na przykład gracz może odzyskać <code>2</code> punkty zdrowia, a następnie otrzymać <code>1</code> punkt obrażeń.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"86\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerHealth = playerHealth + \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerHealth = playerHealth - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>2</code>, a następnie <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146645,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zmienne ustawione na ciągi znaków działają tak samo. Spróbuj ustawić <code>hudText</code> na <code>hudText + \" Level 2\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"79\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hudText = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Now playing:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hudText = hudText + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Level 1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hudText = hudText + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Level 2&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hudText);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>hudText</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146646,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaka wartość została przypisana do zmiennej <code>enemySpeed</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemySpeed = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>enemySpeed</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146647,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemySpeed = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemySpeed = enemySpeed;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemySpeed);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>100</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146648,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemySpeed = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemySpeed = enemySpeed + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemySpeed);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>101</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>100</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>101</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146649,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dlaczego przypisywanie zmiennej jej własnej wartości jest tak potężną koncepcją programistyczną?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ponieważ pozwala nam śledzić dane, które zmieniają się w czasie</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ponieważ pomaga nam tworzyć porównania</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ponieważ pozwala nam śledzić dane, które zmieniają się w czasie.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 146650,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerName = playerName + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Nova&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerName);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Ranger Nova</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Nova Ranger</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Ranger Nova</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 146651,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Przypisz <code>15</code> do zmiennej <code>score</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"16\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>=</code>, a następnie <code>15</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 146652,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Przypisz <code>coins</code> wartość, aby w konsoli wyświetliła się liczba <code>5</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"7\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coins = number;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(coins);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>number</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 146653,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj pięć do wartości zmiennej <code>ammo</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"30\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ammo = \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ammo = ammo + \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(ammo);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>ammo + 5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 146654,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Odejmij jeden od wartości zmiennej <code>lives</code>, a następnie dodaj cztery.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lives = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lives = lives - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lives = lives + \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(lives);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>-</code>, następnie <code>1</code>, a potem <code>+</code>, <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 146655,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wyświetl <code>Pixel Knight</code> w konsoli, kodując <code>characterName</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"58\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" characterName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Pixel&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"characterName = characterName + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(characterName);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>characterName</code>.</p></body></html>"
